<%# 대시보드 경쟁 요약 행 — 아바타 + 채널명 + 구독자 + 증감(콜드면 측정한계/수집 중). local: channel. 다국어 §7·nil 방어. %>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 py-2">
  <%= render "shared/channel_avatar", channel: channel, size: "h-8 w-8" %>
  <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
    <%# 채널명 클릭 → 유튜브 채널로(UC id/핸들 있을 때만 링크, 없으면 일반 텍스트). %>
    <% url = youtube_channel_url(channel) %>
    <% if url %>
      <a href="<%= url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         class="block min-w-0 truncate break-keep text-body text-ink-body hover:text-primary-600 hover:underline" title="<%= channel.name %>"><%= channel.name %></a>
    <% else %>
      <span class="block min-w-0 truncate break-keep text-body text-ink-body" title="<%= channel.name %>"><%= channel.name %></span>
    <% end %>
    <span class="block text-label tabular-nums text-ink-muted">
      구독자 <%= format_subscriber_count(channel.subscriber_count) %>
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="shrink-0">
    <%= render "competitors/subscriber_delta", channel: channel %>
  </div>
</div>
